| `TestEnsureTranscriptBlobs_SomeMissing` | Second fetch triggered, then blobs readable |

**Test setup pattern** (local bare remote):

```go
func setupTestRemote(t *testing.T) (*git.Repository, *git.Repository) {
    // Create bare "remote" repo
    bareDir := t.TempDir()
